#: b2/config/config.cpp:70
msgid ""
"An action can be associated to a double click of the menu button. Leave it "
"to none if in doubt."
msgstr ""
"Tindakan boleh dikaitkan dengan dwi klik butang menu. Tinggalkan kepada "
"tiada jika ragu-ragu."

